<style id="nunchipass-integrated-intro">html.np-intro-pending::after{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;background:#000;opacity:.70;z-index:2147482999;pointer-events:auto}
.np-intro-root{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2147483000;display:grid;place-items:center;isolation:isolate;touch-action:none}
.np-intro-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#000;opacity:.70}
.np-intro-banner{position:relative;width:min(2172px,calc(100vw - 48px),calc((100dvh - 112px)*3));aspect-ratio:3/1;opacity:1;outline:none}
.np-intro-banner img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none;user-select:none}

.np-intro-scene{filter:grayscale(1) brightness(.45);opacity:.65;transition:filter .12s ease,opacity .12s ease}
.np-intro-scene.is-active{filter:grayscale(0) brightness(1);opacity:1}
.np-intro-scene.is-faint{opacity:.25;transition:opacity .48s ease,filter .12s ease}
.np-intro-skip{position:absolute;right:24px;bottom:24px;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;z-index:2}
.np-intro-skip:focus-visible{outline:none;color:#ffcf45}
.np-intro-root.is-finishing .np-intro-banner img:not([data-scene="4"]){opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s ease}
.np-intro-root.is-finishing .np-intro-shade{opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s ease}
.np-intro-root.is-finishing .np-intro-skip{opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s ease;pointer-events:none}
@media(max-width:600px){.np-intro-banner{width:min(calc(100vw - 24px),calc((100dvh - 100px)*3))}.np-intro-skip{right:16px;bottom:16px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.np-intro-root,html.np-intro-pending::after{display:none}
.np-intro-scene{transition:none}}


.np-intro-banner .np-intro-logo{opacity:1;filter:none}

.np-intro-root.is-finishing .np-intro-scene[data-scene="4"]{opacity:1;filter:grayscale(0) brightness(1);transition:none}

.np-intro-root.is-finishing .np-intro-banner .np-intro-logo{opacity:0;transition:opacity .6s ease}

.np-intro-match-layer{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;overflow:hidden}
.np-intro-matched-scene{position:absolute;display:block;max-width:none;max-height:none;object-fit:fill;pointer-events:none;transform:none}
</style><script>try{if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches&&sessionStorage.getItem('nunchipass-intro-v2-bgless-3s-seen')!=='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('np-intro-pending')}catch{}setTimeout(()=>document.documentElement.classList.remove('np-intro-pending'),10000);</script><style>
.np-intro-root .np-intro-skip,.np-intro-root .np-intro-skip:hover,.np-intro-root .np-intro-skip:active,.np-intro-root .np-intro-skip:focus{appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;background:transparent!important;border:0!important;box-shadow:none!important;outline:none!important;border-radius:0}
</style><script>window.NP_PAGE_ART={"game": "https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_001.png", "saved": "https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_002.png", "categories": "https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_003.png", "top10": "https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_004.png", "season": "https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_005.png"};window.NP_SUBTITLE_IMAGE="https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_006.png";window.npDecoratePageHeading=function(view){const src=window.NP_PAGE_ART[view];const head=document.querySelector('#main .page-top');if(!src||!head)return;const copy=document.createElement('div');copy.className='np-page-heading-copy';while(head.firstChild)copy.append(head.firstChild);const img=document.createElement('img');img.className='np-page-heading-art';img.src=src;img.alt='';img.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');head.append(copy,img);head.classList.add('np-page-heading');};</script><style id="np-intro-smile-curve">.np-intro-banner .np-intro-scene[data-scene="2"],.np-intro-banner .np-intro-scene[data-scene="3"]{transform:translateY(6%)}@media(max-width:600px){.np-intro-banner .np-intro-scene[data-scene="2"],.np-intro-banner .np-intro-scene[data-scene="3"]{transform:translateY(5%)}}</style></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">본문으로 건너뛰기</a><header><div class="container header-inner"><div class="np-header-brand"><a class="logo np-header-logo np-reference-brand" href="#home" aria-label="눈치패스 — 어른이 처음인 당신에게 — 홈"><img src="https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_007.svg" alt="눈치패스 — 어른이 처음인 당신에게" width="122" height="104"></a></div><nav aria-label="주 메뉴"><a href="#home" data-nav="home">홈</a><div class="nav-group"><a href="#top10/7" data-nav="top10" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="np-dd-top10">TOP 10 <span class="nav-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m3.5 6 4.5 4.5L12.5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><div class="nav-dropdown" id="np-dd-top10"><a href="#top10/7">최근 7일</a><a href="#top10/30">최근 30일</a><a href="#top10/all">전체 기간</a></div></div><a href="#season" data-nav="season">시즌</a><div class="nav-group"><a href="#categories" data-nav="categories" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="category-dropdown">카테고리 <span class="nav-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m3.5 6 4.5 4.5L12.5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><div class="nav-dropdown" id="category-dropdown"><a href="#categories">전체 카테고리</a><a href="#tips?cat=etiquette">경조사·인간관계</a><a href="#tips?cat=finance">돈 관리·금융생활</a><a href="#tips?cat=housing">자취·주거생활</a><a href="#tips?cat=work">직장·사회생활</a><a href="#tips?cat=admin">생활행정·문제해결</a></div></div><div class="nav-group"><a href="#game" data-nav="game" aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="np-dd-game">Game Lab <span class="nav-chevron" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="m3.5 6 4.5 4.5L12.5 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span></a><div class="nav-dropdown" id="np-dd-game"><a href="#game?mode=type">내 밈캐릭터 찾기 · 9문항</a><a href="#game?mode=practice">눈치 레벨 도전 · 6문항</a></div></div><a href="#saved" data-nav="saved">즐겨찾기</a></nav><div class="tools"><button class="icon-btn" id="search-focus" aria-label="생활 팁 검색"></button><button class="icon-btn" id="theme" aria-label="다크모드 전환"></button><button type="button" class="icon-btn" data-share-site aria-label="눈치패스 홈페이지 공유하기" title="홈페이지 공유"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V3m-5 5 5-5 5 5M5 12v9h14v-9"/></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" class="container"><div class="loading">생활정보를 준비하고 있어요.</div></main><footer><div class="container footer-inner"><div><div class="logo np-footer-logo"><img src="https://dldblb.github.io/nunchipass-assets/images/asset_008.webp" alt="눈치패스" width="247" height="115" decoding="async"></div><p>학교에서는 알려주지 않았던 생활의 모든 것</p><p>사회생활부터 돈 관리까지, 처음 겪는 순간에 필요한 생활 지침서</p></div><div class="footer-right"><p>오프라인 생활백과 · 5개 분야 · 최신 생활 팁</p><p>인터넷 없이 검색·열람할 수 있습니다.</p><p>콘텐츠별 작성 상태와 검증 수준을 표시합니다.</p><p>핵심 답변이 없는 항목은 작성 준비 중으로 표시합니다.</p></div></div></footer><div class="mobile-nav" aria-label="모바일 주 메뉴"></div><div id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><noscript><p>이 웹페이지는 JavaScript를 켜야 검색과 콘텐츠 열람을 사용할 수 있습니다.</p></noscript>
